# The image only needs the runtime overlay tree and the upload sidecar sources.
# Everything else (release tarballs, client build output, diagnostics) is excluded
# on purpose: without this the build context would be several gigabytes.
*

!Dockerfile
!root
!upload-sidecar

# Keep the sidecar sources but never the compiled artifacts.
upload-sidecar/target
**/target
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
*.tar
.git
.docker-codex
.diagnostics
diagnostics
axiver-client
config
tests
docs
scripts
